    "推荐图注结论：Subtype OOD has the strongest deployment-relevant evaluation pressure among the non-random protocols. Under this primary test, ESM-nonlinear achieves the highest mean AUROC overall. Comparing Random CV against Subtype OOD shows that most drug tasks change little, but a subset is substantially overestimated by Random CV."
